_exptl_crystal_grow.pdbx_details    
;Crystals grown by sitting drop vapor diffusion in Cryschem plates with 0.6 ml reservoirs and 6 to 8 ul drops. Drops were equal amounts of a 5 mg/ml virus stock solution buffered at pH 6.5 with 0.1 M phosphate, and the reservoir solution. The reservoir solution was 4% w/v NaCl in 0.1 M phosphate at pH 6.0. Crystallization was at 4 degrees C.
;
_exptl_crystal_grow.pdbx_pH_range   '4.5 - 7.0' 
